{
  "id": "01",
  "title": "Engine Manifesto",
  "content": "<div style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(234, 179, 8, 0.12) 0%, rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.04) 100%); border: 1px solid rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.2); border-left: 4px solid #FBBF24; padding: 32px; margin-bottom: 60px; border-radius: 4px; position: relative; overflow: hidden;\"><div style=\"position: absolute; top: -20px; right: -20px; opacity: 0.1; transform: rotate(15deg);\"><svg width=\"120\" height=\"120\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FBBF24\" stroke-width=\"1\"><path d=\"M13 2L3 14h9l-1 8 10-12h-9l1-8z\"/></svg></div><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--text-heading); font-weight: 300;\">**Photon** is the high-performance HTTP kernel of the Gravito Galaxy. Engineered for the **Bun native runtime**, it achieves **absolute zero overhead** through a Proxy-less context architecture and sub-microsecond dispatch.</p></div><h2>The Core Philosophy</h2><p>Photon provides the foundational routing and request/response handling used by <code>@gravito/core</code> and all Orbit modules. It implements a standalone design with Gravito-specific enhancements while maintaining zero overhead by eliminating dynamic proxy interception.</p><div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 24px; margin: 48px 0;\" class=\"bento-grid\"><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 32px; border-radius: 4px; transition: all 0.3s ease;\" onmouseover=\"this.style.borderColor='rgba(251,191,36,0.4)'; this.style.transform='translateY(-4px)'\" onmouseout=\"this.style.borderColor='var(--border-subtle)'; this.style.transform='translateY(0)'\"> <div style=\"color: #FBBF24; margin-bottom: 20px;\"><svg width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 2v20\"/><path d=\"m17 7-5-5-5 5\"/><path d=\"m17 17-5 5-5-5\"/></svg></div><h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; tracking: 0.05em; border: none; padding: 0;\">BUN_NATIVE</h3><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px; opacity: 0.8; padding: 0; border: none;\">Optimized directly for Bun's C++ core. Zero-copy operations, native WebSockets, and ultra-lightweight internals.</p></div><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 32px; border-radius: 4px; transition: all 0.3s ease;\" onmouseover=\"this.style.borderColor='rgba(251,191,36,0.4)'; this.style.transform='translateY(-4px)'\" onmouseout=\"this.style.borderColor='var(--border-subtle)'; this.style.transform='translateY(0)'\"><div style=\"color: #FBBF24; margin-bottom: 20px;\"><svg width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect width=\"18\" height=\"18\" x=\"3\" y=\"3\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M9 3v18\"/><path d=\"M3 9h18\"/><path d=\"M15 3v18\"/><path d=\"M3 15h18\"/></svg></div><h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; tracking: 0.05em; border: none; padding: 0;\">AOT_MATRICES</h3><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px; opacity: 0.8; padding: 0; border: none;\">Routes and middleware are pre-compiled into Ahead-Of-Time (AOT) matrices, eliminating runtime tree traversal.</p></div><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 32px; border-radius: 4px; transition: all 0.3s ease;\" onmouseover=\"this.style.borderColor='rgba(251,191,36,0.4)'; this.style.transform='translateY(-4px)'\" onmouseout=\"this.style.borderColor='var(--border-subtle)'; this.style.transform='translateY(0)'\"><div style=\"color: #FBBF24; margin-bottom: 20px;\"><svg width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"11\" r=\"3\"/></svg></div><h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; tracking: 0.05em; border: none; padding: 0;\">TYPE_SHIELD</h3><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px; opacity: 0.8; padding: 0; border: none;\">Absolute type safety with zero runtime shim code. The compiler validates your contracts before the engine executes.</p></div></div><h2>The Galaxy Layout</h2><p>Photon sits at the foundational layer of the Gravito ecosystem. It provides the atomic transport layer that connects Orbits, Satellites, and Clients.</p><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 4px; padding: 40px; margin: 40px 0; position: relative;\"><div style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding-bottom: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-technical); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; color: #FBBF24;\">@GRAVITO/CORE</span> <span style=\"color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 10px;\">L4_ORCHESTRATION</span></div><div style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #FBBF24; padding-bottom: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-technical); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 900; color: var(--text-heading);\">@GRAVITO/PHOTON</span> <span style=\"color: #FBBF24; font-size: 10px;\">L3_HTTP_KERNEL (YOU ARE HERE)</span></div><div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 10px;\"><div style=\"border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 10px; font-size: 11px; text-align: center; color: var(--text-muted);\">@BEAM (RPC)</div><div style=\"border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 10px; font-size: 11px; text-align: center; color: var(--text-muted);\">@ION (SPA)</div><div style=\"border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 10px; font-size: 11px; text-align: center; color: var(--text-muted);\">@SENTINEL (AUTH)</div></div></div><h2>Quick Start</h2><h3>Standalone Usage</h3><pre><code>import { Photon } from '@gravito/photon'\nconst app = new Photon()\n\napp.get('/', (c) => c.text('Hello Photon'))\n\nBun.serve({ fetch: app.fetch, port: 3000 })</code></pre><h3>With PlanetCore (Recommended)</h3><pre><code>import { PlanetCore, GravitoAdapter } from '@gravito/core'\n\nconst core = await PlanetCore.boot({ \n  adapter: new GravitoAdapter() \n})\n\ncore.router.get('/', (c) => c.json({ ok: true }))\nexport default core.liftoff()</code></pre><h2>Built-in Power: Middleware</h2><div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 20px; margin: 32px 0;\"><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 24px; border-radius: 4px;\"><h4 style=\"color: #FBBF24; margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 900;\">HTMX_NATIVE</h4><p style=\"font-size: 13px; opacity: 0.8; margin: 0;\">Detection and header injection for HTMX-powered hypermedia applications.</p></div><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 24px; border-radius: 4px;\"><h4 style=\"color: #FBBF24; margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 900;\">BINARY_CBOR</h4><p style=\"font-size: 13px; opacity: 0.8; margin: 0;\">Transparent CBOR encoding for JSON payloads. 2-3x speed boost for client sync.</p></div></div><div style=\"background: rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.05); border: 1px solid rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.1); border-left: 4px solid #FBBF24; padding: 24px; margin: 40px 0; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\"><h4 style=\"margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 900; color: #FBBF24; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em;\">// ENGINE_SPEC: ZERO_EXTERNAL_DEPS</h4><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 15px; font-style: italic; color: var(--text-heading); opacity: 0.9; border: none; padding: 0;\">Photon maintains a hard-line policy of zero production dependencies. Every byte is authored for performance, ensuring that your application doesn't inherit the technical debt of the legacy Node.js ecosystem.</p></div><h2>Performance Metrics</h2><p>Throughput comparison on standardized hardware.</p><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 32px; margin: 40px 0; border-radius: 4px;\"><div style=\"margin-bottom: 24px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; color: #FBBF24; margin-bottom: 12px; font-family: var(--font-technical);\"><span>PHOTON_BUN_OPTIMIZED</span> <span>116,495 RPS</span></div><div style=\"height: 8px; background: rgba(251,191,36,0.1); width: 100%; border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden;\"><div style=\"height: 100%; width: 95%; background: #FBBF24; box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(251,191,36,0.5);\"></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 0;\"><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; color: #6B7280; margin-bottom: 12px; font-family: var(--font-technical);\"><span>EXPRESS_NODE_JS</span> <span>~12,000 RPS</span></div><div style=\"height: 8px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); width: 100%; border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden;\"><div style=\"height: 100%; width: 10%; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2);\"></div></div></div></div><div style=\"background: linear-gradient(to right, rgba(234, 179, 8, 0.1), transparent); border-left: 4px solid #FBBF24; padding: 24px; margin-top: 60px; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\"><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; font-style: italic; border: none; padding: 0; color: var(--text-heading);\">**Architect's Insight:** Most frameworks are built on layers of compromises to maintain backward compatibility. Photon is built for the future. By starting with the Bun native boundary as our baseline, we redefined what is possible for high-density backend systems.</p></div>",
